{"duration": 36.091, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A Union sailor slathers fresh paint on his ship\u2019s side, sweat dripping.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.715}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His comrades snicker, saying the color is just for show.", "start": 4.135, "end": 6.969}, {"beat": 2, "text": "At sunrise the fleet rolls out, cannon smoke rising, eyes scanning the horizon.", "start": 7.389, "end": 11.899}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Confederate guns flash back, searching for any silhouette.", "start": 12.119, "end": 15.017}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like wearing a gray hoodie on a foggy morning\u2014hard to spot.", "start": 15.437, "end": 19.313}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The Navy painted hulls gray to blend with the sea\u2019s edge, making ships vanish against the distant line.", "start": 19.733, "end": 24.858}, {"beat": 4, "text": "That camouflage reduced the chance of being sighted by enemy lookouts.", "start": 25.078, "end": 28.802}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, the same shade helped friendly pilots find the fleet at night, because the gray reflected moonlight.", "start": 29.222, "end": 34.971}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.124, "end": 0.174, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Union", "start": 0.224, "end": 0.524, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sailor", "start": 0.574, "end": 0.924, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "slathers", "start": 0.999, "end": 1.374, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "fresh", "start": 1.424, "end": 1.649, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "paint", "start": 1.699, "end": 1.924, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "on", "start": 1.949, "end": 2.024, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 2.049, "end": 2.124, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "ship\u2019s", "start": 2.174, "end": 2.374, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "side,", "start": 2.424, "end": 2.999, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sweat", "start": 3.074, "end": 3.299, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dripping.", "start": 3.349, "end": 3.749, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "His", "star